,{"w":"popcorn.","s":110.64,"e":111.369}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":111.669,"end":116.731,"text":"Coffee shops. Have you ever noticed the small cup is barely cheaper than the medium?","words":[{"w":"Coffee","s":111.68,"e":112.08},{"w":"shops.","s":112.08,"e":112.72},{"w":"Have","s":112.8,"e":112.96},{"w":"you","s":112.96,"e":113.12},{"w":"ever","s":113.12,"e":113.36},{"w":"noticed","s":113.36,"e":113.68},{"w":"the","s":113.68,"e":113.92},{"w":"small","s":113.92,"e":114.24},{"w":"cup","s":114.24,"e":114.64},{"w":"is","s":114.64,"e":114.88},{"w":"barely","s":114.88,"e":115.28},{"w":"cheaper","s":115.28,"e":115.76},{"w":"than","s":115.76,"e":115.92},{"w":"the","s":115.92,"e":116.08},{"w":"medium?","s":116.08,"e":116.72}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":117.131,"end":122.518,"text":"Now that you mention it, I always buy the medium. Always. I thought that was my personality.","words":[{"w":"Now","s":117.131,"e":117.36},{"w":"that","s":117.36,"e":117.52},{"w":"you","s":117.52,"e":117.6},{"w":"mention","s":117.6,"e":117.92},{"w":"it,","s":117.92,"e":118.32},{"w":"I","s":118.32,"e":118.56},{"w":"always","s":118.56,"e":118.88},{"w":"buy","s":118.88,"e":119.12},{"w":"the","s":119.12,"e":119.28},{"w":"medium.","s":119.28,"e":119.92},{"w":"Always.","s":119.92,"e":120.72},{"w":"I","s":120.88,"e":121.04},{"w":"thought","s":121.04,"e":121.2},{"w":"that","s":121.2,"e":121.36},{"w":"was","s":121.36,"e":121.52},{"w":"my","s":121.52,"e":121.76},{"w":"personality.","s":121.76,"e":122.24}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":122.818,"end":130.202,"text":"It is not your personality, it is the menu. The small exists to look bad. It is the sacrificial size.","words":[{"w":"It","s":122.818,"e":123.025},{"w":"is","s":123.025,"e":123.185},{"w":"not","s":123.185,"e":123.425},{"w":"your","s":123.425,"e":123.665},{"w":"personality,","s":123.665,"e":124.385},{"w":"it","s":124.385,"e":124.545},{"w":"is","s":124.545,"e":124.705},{"w":"the","s":124.705,"e":124.865},{"w":"menu.","s":124.865,"e":125.585},{"w":"