ter.","s":143.04,"e":143.489}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":143.789,"end":152.984,"text":"Exactly. 'This is a total rip-off,' or as a verb, 'they ripped me off.' Informal, extremely common, and always slightly outraged.","words":[{"w":"Exactly.","s":143.789,"e":144.56},{"w":"'This","s":144.56,"e":144.8},{"w":"is","s":144.8,"e":144.96},{"w":"a","s":144.96,"e":145.12},{"w":"total","s":145.12,"e":145.36},{"w":"rip-off,'","s":145.36,"e":146.16},{"w":"or","s":146.16,"e":146.56},{"w":"as","s":146.56,"e":146.88},{"w":"a","s":146.88,"e":146.96},{"w":"verb,","s":146.96,"e":147.36},{"w":"'they","s":147.36,"e":147.52},{"w":"ripped","s":147.52,"e":147.76},{"w":"me","s":147.76,"e":148},{"w":"off.'","s":148,"e":148.665},{"w":"Informal,","s":148.665,"e":149.625},{"w":"extremely","s":149.705,"e":150.265},{"w":"common,","s":150.265,"e":150.905},{"w":"and","s":150.985,"e":151.145},{"w":"always","s":151.145,"e":151.705},{"w":"slightly","s":151.705,"e":152.185},{"w":"outraged.","s":152.185,"e":152.984}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":153.284,"end":157.51,"text":"The outrage is built into the word. Nobody calmly describes a rip-off.","words":[{"w":"The","s":153.284,"e":153.465},{"w":"outrage","s":153.465,"e":153.865},{"w":"is","s":153.865,"e":154.105},{"w":"built","s":154.105,"e":154.265},{"w":"into","s":154.265,"e":154.505},{"w":"the","s":154.505,"e":154.665},{"w":"word.","s":154.665,"e":155.225},{"w":"Nobody","s":155.385,"e":155.785},{"w":"calmly","s":155.785,"e":156.265},{"w":"describes","s":156.265,"e":156.665},{"w":"a","s":156.665,"e":156.905},{"w":"rip-off.","s":156.905,"e":157.51}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":157.81,"end":162.036,"text":"Never. Okay, next exhibit: subscription plans.","words":[{"w":"Never.","s":157.865,"e":158.505},{"w":"Okay,","s":158.825,"e":159.465},{"w":"next","s":159.625,"e":159.945},{"w":"exhibit:","s":159.945,"e":160.745},{"w":"subscription","s":160.825,"e":161.385},{"w":"plans.","s":161.385,"e":161.785}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":162.336,"end":163.079,"text":"Oh no.","words":[{"w":"Oh","s":162.336,"e":162.79},{"w":"no.","s":162.79,"e":163.079}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":163.379,"end":171.228,"text":"There is a famous experiment by the behavioral economist Dan Ariely, using the old subscription page of The Economist magazine.","words":[{"w":"There","s":163.379,"e":163.67},{"w":"is","s":163.67,"e":163.83},{"w":"a","s":163.83,"e":163.99},{"w":"famous","s":163.99,"e":164.31},{"w":"experiment","s":164.31,"e":164.87},{"w":"by","s":164.87,"e":165.03},{"w":"the","s":165.03,"e":165.19},{"w":"behavioral","s":165.19,"e":165.75},{"w":"economist","s":165.75,"e":166.39},{"w":"Dan","s":166.39,"e":166.55},{"w":"Ariely,","s":166.55,"e":167.59},{"w":"using","s":167.59,"e":167.99},{"w":"the","s":167.99,"e":168.23},{"w":"old","s":168.23,"e":168.55},{"w":"subscription","s":168.55,"e":169.19},{"w":"page","s":169.19,"e":169.59},{"w":"of","s":169.59,"e":169.75},{"w":"The","s":169.75,"e":169.91},{"w":"Economist","s":169.91,"e":170.47},{"w":"magazine.","s":170.47,"e":171.228}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":171.528,"end":173.85,"text":"The magazine? What did they do?","words":[{"w":"The","s":171.528,"e":171.75},{"w":"magazine?","s":171.75,"e":172.55},{"w":"What","s":172.79,"e":173.11},{"w":"did","s":173.11,"e":173.27},{"w":"they","s":173.27,"e":173.43},{"w":"do?","s":173.43,"e":173.85}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":174.25,"end":183.956,"text":"Three options. Web only, cheap. Print only, expensive. And print plus web together, for exactly the same price as print alone.","words":[{"w":"Three","s":174.31,"e":174.55},{"w":"options.","s":174.55,"e":174.95},{"w":"Web","s":175.695,"e":176.015},{"w":"only,","s":176.015,"e":176.735},{"w":"cheap.","s":176.735,"e":177.535},{"w":"Print","s":177.775,"e":178.095},{"w":"only,","s":178.095,"e":178.415},{"w":"expensive.","s":178.415,"e":179.455},{"w":"And","s":179.535,"e":179.695},{"w":"print","s":179.695,"e":180.095},{"w":"plus","s":180.095,"e":180.495},{"w":"web","s":180.495,"e":180.815},{"w":"together,","s":180.815,"e":181.295},{"w":"for","s":181.295,"e":181.695},{"w":"exactly","s":181.695,"e":182.175},{"w":"the","s":182.175,"e":182.335},{"w":"same","s":182.335,"e":182.575},{"w":"price","s":182.575,"e":182.815},{"w":"as","s":182.815,"e":183.055},{"w":"print","s":183.055,"e":183.375},{"w":"alone.","s":183.375,"e":183.956}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":184.256,"end":189.782,"text":"Wait, the same price? Then print only is pointless. Nobody would ever choose it.","words":[{"w":"Wait,","s":184.256,"e":184.895},{"w":"the","s":184.895,"e":185.135},{"w":"same","s":185.135,"e":185.375},{"w":"price?","s":185.375,"e":186.015},{"w":"Then","s":186.335,"e":186.575},{"w":"print","s":186.575,"e":186.975},{"w":"only","s":186.975,"e":187.295},{"w":"is","s":187.295,"e":187.535},{"w":"pointless.","s":187.535,"e":188.255},{"w":"Nobody","s":188.335,"e":188.815},{"w":"would","s":188.815,"e":188.975},{"w":"ever","s":188.975,"e":189.215},{"w":"choose","s":189.215,"e":189.535},{"w":"it.","s":189.535,"e":189.615}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":190.082,"end":200.113,"text":"Nobody did. But with that useless option on the page, most people picked the expensive combo. Remove it, and most people picked the cheap web option instead.","words":[{"w":"Nobody","s":190.082,"e":190.54},{"w":"did.","s":190.54,"e":191.18},{"w":"But","s":191.34,"e":191.5},{"w":"with","s":191.5,"e":191.74},{"w":"that","s":191.74,"e":191.9},{"w":"useless","s":191.9,"e":192.38},{"w":"option","s":192.38,"e":192.78},{"w":"on","s":192.78,"e":192.94},{"w":"the","s":192.94,"e":193.1},{"w":"page,","s":193.1,"e":193.74},{"w":"most","s":193.74,"e":194.06},{"w":"people","s":194.06,"e":194.3},{"w":"picked","s":194.3,"e":194.7},{"w":"the","s":194.7,"e":194.94},{"w":"expensive","s":194.94,"e":195.42},{"w":"combo.","s":195.42,"e":196.14},{"w":"Remove","s":196.3,"e":196.62},{"w":"it,","s":196.62,"e":197.18},{"w":"and","s":197.18,"e":197.34},{"w":"most","s":197.34,"e":197.58},{"w":"people","s":197.58,"e":197.82},{"w":"picked","s":197.82,"e":198.14},{"w":"the","s":198.14,"e":198.3},{"w":"cheap","s":198.3,"e":198.62},{"w":"web","s":198.62,"e":199.02},{"w":"option","s":199.02,"e":199.42},{"w":"instead.","s":199.42,"e":200.113}]},{"speaker":"Ethan","start":200.413,"end":206.915,"text":"So the pointless option quietly steered everyone toward spending more. That is elegant and evil at the same time.","words":[{"w":"So","s":200.413,"e":200.62},{"w":"the","s":200.62,"e":200.7},{"w":"pointless","s":200.7,"e":201.18},{"w":"option","s":201.18,"e":201.58},{"w":"quietly","s":201.58,"e":202.06},{"w":"steered","s":202.06,"e":202.46},{"w":"everyone","s":202.46,"e":202.94},{"w":"toward","s":202.94,"e":203.18},{"w":"spending","s":203.18,"e":203.58},{"w":"more.","s":203.58,"e":203.82},{"w":"That","s":204.505,"e":204.825},{"w":"is","s":204.825,"e":204.985},{"w":"elegant","s":204.985,"e":205.385},{"w":"and","s":205.385,"e":205.545},{"w":"evil","s":205.545,"e":205.865},{"w":"at","s":205.865,"e":206.105},{"w":"the","s":206.105,"e":206.265},{"w":"same","s":206.265,"e":206.425},{"w":"time.","s":206.425,"e":206.905}]},{"speaker":"Sarah","start":207.215,"end":214.227,"text":"There is a lovely verb for that: to nudge someone into something. A nudge is literally a gentle push with your elbow.","words":[{"w":"There","s":207.225,"e":207.625},{"w":"is","s":207.625,"e":207.785},{"w":"a","s":207.785,"e":207.865},{"w":"lovely","s":207.865,"e":208.185},{"w":"verb","s":208.185,"e":208.505},{"w":"for","s":208.505,"e":208.745},{"w":"that:","s":208.745,"e":209.145},{"w":"to","s":209.145,"e":209.305},{"w":"nudge","s":209.305,"e":209.705},{"w":"someone","s":209.705,"e":210.105},{"w":"into","s":210.105,"e":210.505},{"w":"something.","s":210.505,"e":211.145},{"w":"A","s":211.305,"e":211.465},{"w":"nudge","s":211.465,"e":211.785},{"w":"is","s":211.785,"e":211.945},{"w":"literally","s":211.945,"e":212.345},{"w":"a","s":212.345,"e":212.585},{"w":"gentle","s":212.585,"e":212.985},{"w":"push","s":212.985,"e":213.225},{"w":"with","s":213.225,"e":213.465},{